Significant changes made in Soiboi relative to upstream Sylvakru:

  - Rebranded application identity (package name, application id, display
    name, packaging metadata, platform method-channel identifiers).
  - Added an integration with a self-hosted download pipeline service
    (download_bridge), providing an in-app flow for archiving Apple Music
    playlists to the local library.
  - Added a discovery view surfacing weekly generated playlists from that
    service.
  - Added synced-lyrics retrieval from LRCLIB, complementing the existing
    local .lrc and server-provided lyrics sources.
  - Reworked the colour system into a multi-flavour theme token model,
    replacing the fixed light/dark/vivid colour modes.
  - Surfaced per-track codec and quality information (e.g. ALAC, AAC 320)
    throughout the library and player interfaces.
  - Copy-editing pass over the English UI strings.

The full modification history is preserved in this repository's git history,
which retains all upstream Sylvakru commits.
